;">The agenda</h2></div></td></tr>
<tr><td align=3D"left" class=3D"text" style=3D"background:#FFFFFF;font-size=
:0px;padding:0 16px;word-break:break-word;"><div style=3D"font-family:Georg=
ia, serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:22px;text-align:left;c=
olor:#121212;">
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Crypto scammers are now in =E2=80=9Coverdr=
ive=E2=80=9D, a co-founder of the cryptocurrency exchange Binance has warne=
d, as customers pull billions in funds from the platform as it recovers fro=
m a record hack.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The platform was hit by a $6.3bn (=C2=A34.=
7bn) theft on Thursday, which has since been described as the biggest heist=
 in history. Experts identified <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguar=
dian.com/ss/c/u001.5EvR0nnoZ0EI0sGdYUHnEBrX92Ff0Wp9SQ124Cje-bwydRgNkSO4TTEB=
2ON_FVkOqmPVbsqrTPgKRovb_CkVK6LbWoA_aeKcM_Y60g3pgYXns6jfHQfbQ8u2i7vdYMYnsDl=
Ajx9CsovSMmsYy-aa5dSL9oEhZP7WNZ40gf-xkzTR26SzArZxqwWr6zeZWWXPVR9OZgLmZoSXKz=
ccbouBTRIwcdbz8LSjDpBfzmGvr6jl3bNh_vgEBNooBbPACANkTxSjHcQoHKiPMmq61JRrQA/4v=
e/ZPJCITvrSs-X9z_JYlH67w/h30/h001.EKJRrSNIr4QaFKoqQKooFoOCQx8BxhTKt9jrRyxxp=
Jo" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">North Korea as the probable culprit</a>.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Binance initially froze withdrawals as it =
investigated the breach but on Sunday announced it had <a href=3D"https://a=
blink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.5EvR0nnoZ0EI0sGdYUHnEBrX92Ff0Wp9S=
Q124Cje-bwydRgNkSO4TTEB2ON_FVkOjbHr-sqt4QeeEH1JalMBCCEt69fHSN2Z9cEiSYjqeFwB=
vi5cRJmDwR9tFHao8ezd_KJlmFeU54NnWG20EtXDCWhjQ8TIascBz8hCZian_7cIItmL5vFUKa9=
-LXQUMMB5FmRbzvPWYizVHo_CrQ5jd6NiZ3jpCVYneWPcRKvCwC9lw2qftEeJmHoeJXUPvOm0GY=
KbTXRnWrg7lwr_z4Xxx2RVUKGs8DBUOMUnLRYxAzfmOBoabu3to3ZDe1ioManC/4ve/ZPJCITvr=
Ss-X9z_JYlH67w/h31/h001.zb5CzYfcLA8aZwnZ8wRzDerOey5Dru_zYNv6uPa5czc" style=
=3D"color: #0077B6;">begun a phased reopening</a>.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">By Sunday afternoon, the platform had proc=
essed $4.6bn in withdrawals and $1bn in deposits, resulting in a net outflo=
w of about $3.6bn =E2=80=93 2.1% of its $171bn in total assets under manage=
ment. (Those numbers were confirmed by the company in its latest proof of r=
eserves snapshot =E2=80=93 a full report is expected today.)</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Changpeng Zhao, a co-founder of the platfo=
rm, has warned that scammers are now targeting those who are trying to pull=
 their money from the platform. He wrote on X: =E2=80=9CScammers on over dr=
ive now. Be careful.=E2=80=9D</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">His post was in response to a <a href=3D"h=
ttps://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.QvkQtXiSzSINXrMyEJiuYrkUL=
SDvADnNsAeEmFzXQ4ezxRX7HBqy_ZmSOR7KyaaIq0SaylLkKfKXeCvpRnH7wHxMA_957wVyRiED=
pGWMLrrcz-fxIaLwy9ZIo_JFpN5fh7PCPdlBYg19q9bN18MCLSN4wxV-fr5I_bvrug6wToyvWQz=
VHfapweMzD6l47mbYfJqvojw3MZHyhvg9zD_VccG1hpA8BFmUi1PtX9AdWT7xL_KfHK0AcHZyjx=
HUy1za/4ve/ZPJCITvrSs-X9z_JYlH67w/h32/h001.aXnnfn_1p_7O_LIIvb3JQa4aDjJJnaia=
81K2xCrxWL0" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">post</a> from the Binance team that =
said: =E2=80=9CSome of you may have seen posts and screenshots circulating =
recently. Please be aware that these screenshots are fake and the informati=
on in them is false. For accurate and up-to-date information, always refer =
to our official channels and announcements.=E2=80=9D</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The hack has spooked the market, with inve=
stors also pulling out funds from bitcoin exchange-traded funds in the US, =
according to Nick Forster, the chief executive of Derive.xyz, a crypto plat=
form. He said: =E2=80=9CUS spot bitcoin ETFs recorded $643m in net outflows=
 on Friday, their first trading session following the hack.=E2=80=9D</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The rival trading platform Chainalysis sai=
d on Friday it had also been the target of a cyber-attack, although it foun=
d no evidence of unauthorised access to =E2=80=9Cinvestigation content, aut=
hentication credentials, or session tokens=E2=80=9D.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">It said in a statement: =E2=80=9COur team =
is working with leading cybersecurity experts to investigate this activity =
and harden our systems. We=E2=80=99ve proactively notified all of our custo=
mers and will keep them updated as our work progresses. This security incid=
ent is not related to the recent crypto theft at Binance.=E2=80=9D</p>
